Z||000003||theogre||06-05-2001||07:27 PM||||What in the H_ll brake fluid costs 47$ for 2 quarts? I get Valvoline synthetic at wall mart for about $5.00 a quart... <P>If that's silicone you are asking for trouble. Silicone fluid has a nasty habit of aerating if you pump the pedal. The fact it doesn't draw water is not a good thing on a street driven car. No brake maker I can find recomends the stuff for anything but rarely driven show cars.||||reg||1
