Z||000005||GT Bastard||06-05-2001||10:48 PM||||I'm guessing he's talking about DOT 5 fluid.  the blue stuff.... Trav origionally used it in my clutch hydraulics, and when I went to change the slave cylinder I bought some more from NAPA.  It's not cheap, but it's suppose to be very resistant to thermal breakdown, etc...||||reg||1
