Z||000007||1FST2M6||06-06-2001||07:59 AM||||yeah it's DOT 5.1... $23.XX per quart. on the Brembo and KVR real big brake kits that i've installed on friends cars and customers cars at the shop that what i've used and never had one come back yet... might as well do it right the first time.. instead of doing it 2-3 times with the crappy DOT 3-4. ||||reg||1
